  "body": "本轮按Citlali6[最新评论](https://github.com/Tom-mr33/AmazingHand-based-on-FPGA/issues/17#issuecomment-6247649307)实际重构CSI clkdet/FIFO/reference CDC及SERDES时钟连接。仅使用现有Vivado2020.1，在全新目录完成唯一一次全设计validate→OOC/main synth→place/route→bit/XSA（exit0）。**已建模路径setup/hold/pulse均满足，整机CDC为0 Critical/0 Warning；仍为UNSAFE / NOT DEPLOYABLE。**严格打包因RTSTAT-10真实拒绝，未生成bin/部署包，未上板。Refs #17；继续原个人分支及此Draft。\n\n先读[结果、风险及最小后续工作](https://github.com/Tom-mr33/AmazingHand-based-on-FPGA/blob/db7e0f5a9859d11d556e2d7dc9d85d299ccf94ef/fpga/camera_hil/evidence/cdc-2020.1/README.md)，再看[完整命令/产物/源码/证据SHA256](https://github.com/Tom-mr33/AmazingHand-based-on-FPGA/blob/db7e0f5a9859d11d556e2d7dc9d85d299ccf94ef/fpga/camera_hil/evidence/cdc-2020.1/result.json)。[原始与规范化证据映射](https://github.com/Tom-mr33/AmazingHand-based-on-FPGA/blob/db7e0f5a9859d11d556e2d7dc9d85d299ccf94ef/fpga/camera_hil/evidence/cdc-2020.1/all-evidence.json)包含52项真实日志/报告；前轮证据保留不改。\n\n### 实际结构修复\n\n- byte域真实heartbeat FF→3级XPM同步入PL0→注册missing状态→3级XPM复位返回byte，处理停高/停低和重启，不直接将clock net当单级CDC data。\n- 各RDY先分别同步ref，再注册qualification；目标byte域单一XPM复位和64cycle应用资格。FIFO复用完整local linkreset清空旧数据、实际busy/full/empty门控、3级ready跨域及stream reset门控；AXIS valid独立于tready。FIFO原4096×42 auto/FWFT参数未变。\n- BUFGCE_DIV CLR同步至undivided HS；16个实际routed ISERDESE3均CLK/CLK_B同net、local inversion=`1'b1`，目标SERDES→bytealign hold最差+0.357ns。没有hold豁免、任意delay或降频。[实际物理/driver证据](https://github.com/Tom-mr33/AmazingHand-based-on-FPGA/blob/db7e0f5a9859d11d556e2d7dc9d85d299ccf94ef/fpga/camera_hil/evidence/cdc-2020.1/physical-cdc.txt) / [hold报告](https://github.com/Tom-mr33/AmazingHand-based-on-FPGA/blob/db7e0f5a9859d11d556e2d7dc9d85d299ccf94ef/fpga/camera_hil/evidence/cdc-2020.1/serdes-hold.rpt)。首次脚本将`1'b1`错比整数1，原失败脚本/log及独立net/driver取证均保留，修复的是审计表示解析，没有改已完成设计。\n- 既有共享301.055970MHz参考、14CTRL/16DELAY共同校准和1424个受限URAM tie0保留；REQP-1869仍0。34块BD=原32+AHIL+共享reference，原11地址/PS/DDR/AXI/stream时钟保持，AHIL4KiB@0xA1000000。\n- v3精确私有补丁仅在实验副本改6HDL+component.xml，逐字节重算/验证实际ipshared；原相机117文件、4份继承HIL及strict入口不动。部署STOP/watchdog/session/回退逻辑保留，增加真实bus-skew非负门禁和VHDL源hash；零DRC/覆盖/CDC要求不放松。\n\n### 真实前后对比\n\n| 检查 | 旧P0 run04 | 本轮fresh CDC run01 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| WNS/TNS | -1.986/-146.397ns，92失败端点 | +0.574/0ns，0失败 |\n| WHS/THS | -0.121/-0.126ns，2失败 | +0.010/0ns，0失败 |\n| WPWS | +0.012ns，0失败 | +0.012ns，0失败 |\n| CDC Critical/Warning |44/64 |0/0，仅CDC3 Info25+CDC9 Info14 |\n| 内部覆盖 |no_clock0/internal unconstrained0 |保持0/0 |\n| 外部覆盖 |input20/output8未约束 |仍20/8，不宣称完整时序签收 |\n| bus-skew |未单独门禁 |真实12项，最小+4.079ns；PASS |\n| DRC |REQP0，RTSTAT1/60nets |保持REQP0、RTSTAT1/60nets；hook实际删0 |\n| 打包 |exit1 timing拒绝 |exit1：DRC must have zero violations |\n| 实板 |未测 |未加载组合PL，未测 |\n\nCDC逐规则：CDC1 8→0、7 8→0、10 16→0、12 8→0、13 4→0，CDC15 Warning64→0。旧逻辑clkdet/FIFO-ready/divider各4Critical，前轮新增reference/app/phy结构32Critical；Warning按8旧clkdet+56新ready/reset分别归类。[真实旧路径分类](https://github.com/Tom-mr33/AmazingHand-based-on-FPGA/blob/db7e0f5a9859d11d556e2d7dc9d85d299ccf94ef/fpga/camera_hil/evidence/cdc-2020.1/prior-cdc-categories.json)。没有把局部单CSI0Critical冒充整机结果。\n\n[最终timing](https://github.com/Tom-mr33/AmazingHand-based-on-FPGA/blob/db7e0f5a9859d11d556e2d7dc9d85d299ccf94ef/fpga/camera_hil/evidence/cdc-2020.1/timing_impl.rpt) · [CDC](https://github.com/Tom-mr33/AmazingHand-based-on-FPGA/blob/db7e0f5a9859d11d556e2d7dc9d85d299ccf94ef/fpga/camera_hil/evidence/cdc-2020.1/cdc_impl.rpt) · [DRC](https://github.com/Tom-mr33/AmazingHand-based-on-FPGA/blob/db7e0f5a9859d11d556e2d7dc9d85d299ccf94ef/fpga/camera_hil/evidence/cdc-2020.1/drc_impl.rpt) · [methodology](https://github.com/Tom-mr33/AmazingHand-based-on-FPGA/blob/db7e0f5a9859d11d556e2d7dc9d85d299ccf94ef/fpga/camera_hil/evidence/cdc-2020.1/methodology_impl.rpt) · [真实Vivado完整日志](https://github.com/Tom-mr33/AmazingHand-based-on-FPGA/blob/db7e0f5a9859d11d556e2d7dc9d85d299ccf94ef/fpga/camera_hil/evidence/cdc-2020.1/vivado.txt)\n\n### 验证边界和剩余阻断\n\n- [聚焦XSim真实通过](https://github.com/Tom-mr33/AmazingHand-based-on-FPGA/blob/db7e0f5a9859d11d556e2d7dc9d85d299ccf94ef/fpga/camera_hil/evidence/cdc-2020.1/fault-tests.txt)：初始reset、MMCM失锁/重锁、RDY延迟/丢失、byte停高/停低/重启、64cycle资格、FIFO busy/full/empty/背压/stream reset及实际XPM FIFO旧数据flush/新数据恢复。既有HIL100行bench真实STOP/watchdog/断连检查通过；bench匹配origin/main，继承RTL不改。另9项安全/打包拒绝和1项private源码/ledger篡改拒绝检查通过；30项源码及52项证据staged blob hash匹配。\n- 额外`SIM_ASSERT_CHK=1`诊断**不clean**：S4/S5/S6/S7原始错误保留。最终按原生产默认0并独立验证busy/empty/数据/over-underflow，不等同这些额外断言通过；未无依据断言全是库bug。早期错误FIFO test profile timeout及局部CDC11修复过程均保留。\n- [逐端口20input/8output最小外部依据](https://github.com/Tom-mr33/AmazingHand-based-on-FPGA/blob/db7e0f5a9859d11d556e2d7dc9d85d299ccf94ef/fpga/camera_hil/experimental_2020_1/IO_TIMING.md)仍缺sensor边沿/skew、oscillator tolerance、bridge/cable/FMC/PCB极值及IIC/reset要求。名义171.875MHz由本机25MHz资料/寄存器推导，不能代替实物签收；无猜测delay/泛falsepath。\n- RTSTAT受保护vendor/debug/AXI内部60net缺供应方支持的无功能影响处理，零DRC门禁保持；不强删、不改severity/VDMA模式。methodology仍64项，含**8个private CSI reset组合LUT异步复位alert**；CDC0不代表这些已签收，须进一步reset方法学/脉冲行为审查。\n- 正常非连续HS/frame gap也可能触发约1usclockloss，背压时FIFOflush可能丢帧尾。四word自检不证明TUSER/TLAST/完整帧/VDMA恢复；后续须聚焦协议验证及另获授权同bit相机+HIL实测。当前原camera实机可用与此私有profile验收是不同证据。\n\n### 复现及本地产物\n\n使用新目录，详见[入口说明](https://github.com/Tom-mr33/AmazingHand-based-on-FPGA/blob/db7e0f5a9859d11d556e2d7dc9d85d299ccf94ef/fpga/camera_hil/experimental_2020_1/README.md)：\n\n```powershell\npython fpga/camera_hil/experimental_2020_1/run_local_tests.py --output F:/ah-camera-hil-faults-new\npython fpga/camera_hil/experimental_2020_1/prepare.py --output F:/ah-camera-hil-cdc-new --stage impl --repair-csi\n& F:/Xilinx/Vivado/2020.1/bin/vivado.bat -mode batch -nojournal -log F:/ah-camera-hil-cdc-new/vivado.log -source F:/ah-camera-hil-cdc-new/rebuild.tcl\npython fpga/camera_hil/audit.py --build F:/ah-camera-hil-cdc-new\n```\n\n诊断二进制**只留本地、未上传GitHub、禁止部署**：\n\n- `F:/ah-camera-hil-cdc-run01/vivado/mipi_dp.runs/impl_1/design_1_wrapper.bit`，12134116B，SHA256 `3103b4f875fe3019a83274f440b8a7dd71e88754ce41ecb5e7a3fe2228688e6a`。\n- `F:/ah-camera-hil-cdc-run01/camera_hil.xsa`，2330915B，SHA256 `f518bf32fa55aa6b64322393aead38023bc977640a864028b9b52791cd117f81`；内嵌唯一bit逐字节等于外部bit。\n\n未执行SSH/PL加载/driver装卸/PS初始化/网络/SD修改/重启或安装工具；没有接线需求，不开始Issue20。原独立camera/HIL回退profile保留。开工branch point仍ee52f09；核查main=`6b1c90094e9979d1729a331896954a12821c7ae2`（#12/#13/#14此前外部合并），未自动同步/rebase/merge。\n\n完整HEAD：`db7e0f5a9859d11d556e2d7dc9d85d299ccf94ef`。保持OPEN Draft，待团队Review/Approve和授权人员人工合并；不自动合并、不删分支。日开发日志A/B段由团队后续人工集成。\n",
